<main><div class="wrap"><article class="article"><div class="crumbs">CRANIO / Engineer’s Logbook</div><h1>Show how CRANIO learns.</h1><p class="lead">Observations, experiments, geometry, anatomy, comparisons and open questions.</p><section class="section"><div class="eyebrow">Engineer’s Logbook</div><h2>Show how CRANIO learns.</h2><p class="lead">Observations, experiments, geometry, anatomy, comparisons and open questions.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>Observation</h3><p>Separate observation from interpretation.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Context</h3><p>Context makes a state comparable over time.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Verification</h3><p>Before, after, context and time remain visible.</p></div></div></section><div class="actions"><a class="btn dark" href="../start/">Start an observation</a><a class="btn" href="../explore/">Explore</a></div></article></div></main>